# SAVE while a restore waits for the music to fade (a unit whose flash part refused erase-suspend: the host's default path): the restore still lands, the
# store does not take its place and leave backup/restore refused until a restart (audit B-01)
seed 0
wait 3000
tap GLO
tap SAVE
wait 500
expect saved 1
wait 1500
restore 0
expect rsstate 1
tap SAVE
wait 800
expect rsstate 2
expect storelock 1
